# ---- Server ----
PORT=3000
# Express "trust proxy" (false | true | number of hops | loopback,linklocal,uniquelocal | IP/CIDR list).
# Behind the Docker nginx reverse proxy use "uniquelocal" so rate limits apply to the real client IP.
TRUST_PROXY=false
# Comma separated origins allowed via CORS / Origin check. Empty = same-origin only (recommended with the reverse proxy).
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=
# Optional shared secret required in the "x-api-inspector-token" header (set it in the UI Settings).
ACCESS_TOKEN=

# ---- Abuse protection ----
RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=60000
RATE_LIMIT_MAX=120
PROXY_MAX_CONCURRENCY=20
PROXY_MAX_CONCURRENCY_PER_CLIENT=5

# ---- Proxy limits ----
PROXY_TIMEOUT_MS=30000
PROXY_MAX_TIMEOUT_MS=120000
PROXY_MAX_RESPONSE_BYTES=10485760
PROXY_MAX_REQUEST_BODY_BYTES=5242880
PROXY_MAX_REDIRECTS=5
PROXY_USER_AGENT=API-Inspector/1.0

# ---- Destination policy ----
# DANGEROUS: allows loopback/private ranges (local development against local APIs only). Metadata endpoints stay blocked.
PROXY_ALLOW_PRIVATE_NETWORKS=false
# Extra blocked hosts (exact or ".suffix")
PROXY_BLOCKED_HOSTS=
# When set, ONLY these hosts (exact or ".suffix") can be reached — recommended for public deployments.
PROXY_ALLOWED_HOSTS=

# In-process demo API at http://demo.api-inspector.invalid (no network access).
DEMO_API_ENABLED=true
